      "id": "U7U-READ-1",
      "title": "The Missing Computer",
      "text": "Last month, someone stole the new computer in our school office. The teachers asked the police to look into the case. Two officers came to look over every classroom, and they inspected the windows and doors carefully. At first, everyone in my class was a suspect except me, because I was sick at home that day. The police said the person who did it committed a serious crime. Three days later, they arrested a young man near the night market and put him in jail. He was not a murderer, but he expected easy money. Our school is not perfect, but the teachers did an excellent job that week. Since then, our teacher reminds us to lock the office door every day. Now we all look forward to a safer school."
    }
